  "transformations": [
    "One-cell scalar specialization of complete selected startup CNEVECI/CLSKEW3 IREP0/CDERII arithmetic; other IREP branches are unsupported, not approximated.",
    "Unused X21 startup dead stores omitted; array loops reduce to one cell and raw fixed-size POD records.",
    "Selected centered uniform CINMAS mass and native total-inertia expression retained; physical and area-added partitions remain separate diagnostics.",
    "Binary64 sqrt, division and left-associated operations preserved; no rsqrt, fast math or fused multiply-add enabled for qualification.",
    "Added finite/material/convexity/determinant-boundary checks and staged output; this is explicitly narrower than general native input acceptance.",
    "Generic Vec3/Matrix3 records extracted with compatibility aliases; no Reissner chart or frame arithmetic moved.",
    "Q3b retains selected engine CLSKEW3 IREP0 normalization, distinct from starter CLSKEW3; current sums/differences preserve source order.",
    "CZCORC1 explicit path gathers endpoint positions and midpoint rates, applies source velocity correction, full projection, then normalizes rate differences.",
    "CORTDIR3 IREP0/IDRAPE0 is a verified donor no-op; no synthetic callback or reachable stub.",
    "CZCORP5 IRESP2 full warped projection retains planar switch, inline six-entry inverse and source floors; IRESP1 A3INVDP_V is not called.",
    "CZDEF IVECTOR0/OFFG1 retains all eight regular and six hourglass rates, including warped curvature additions.",
    "One private coherent work record retains later Q3c intermediates. Named public diagnostics retain raw/effective warp and flat VQN +Z/DI DB zeros.",
    "Reference POD stays caller-immutable; bounded sane-field checks are not provenance authentication and do not repeat startup.",
    "Prescribed finite time must advance; sample_index is only a caller label. Failed operations preserve all public output bytes.",
    "Q1 exact planar rigid-rate truth retains O(h) transverse shear; no dynamics or zero-step initial-force claim.",
    "Q3b first-run correction: explicitly promote native default-REAL32 literals 3.413,0.7071,0.78,0.22 to binary64 in characteristic length; MYREAL8 does not change literal kinds. Other selected raw literals are exactly representable, named constants retain their MYREAL8 source values."
  ],
